## UI & UX Patterns

**Design language:**
- Deep dark background everywhere (`#0f0f12` / `bg-dark`)
- Two accent colors: `brand` (purple `#6C3BFF`) for primary actions, `accent` (green `#00E5A0`) for success/status
- `midGray` for all secondary text and borders
- Rounded-2xl cards (16px radius) with 1px `border-midGray/60` and subtle `bg-white/[0.03]` glass
- No external component library — everything is hand-built Tailwind CSS

**Animation philosophy:**
- Framer Motion `initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 12–18 }} animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}` on almost every screen mount
- Scale micro-interactions on cards: `whileHover={{ scale: 1.015 }} whileTap={{ scale: 0.985 }}`
- AnimatePresence for modal enter/exit
- Spinning border ring for loading states; scale-in bounce for checkmarks and error icons

**Accessibility:**
- `role="status"` on the workspace toast notice
- Disabled states on buttons (`disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed`)
- Semantic `<header>`, `<main>`, `<aside>`, `<footer>` landmarks used in key screens
- No explicit ARIA labels on interactive icons — gaps exist

**Responsive behavior:**
- Most layouts use `sm:` and `md:` breakpoints
- AgentSelect: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3`
- BoltStyleChat sidebar: icon rail (56px) collapses to full panel (224px) on `md:` and above
- Sticky footers in setup flows use `fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0` with `backdrop-blur`

